hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"133","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main tera banda hun, tere bande ka beta, teri bandi ka beta; meri peshani tere hath mein hai; mere baare mein tera hukm jari hai, mere baare mein tera faisla adl hai; tere har naam ke waste Tujhse mangta hun jis se Tune apne aap ko pukara, ya use apni kitab mein nazil kiya, ya apni makhluq mein se kisi ko sikhaya, ya apne pas ghaib ke ilm mein mehfooz rakha: Quran ko mere dil ki bahar, mere seenay ka nur, mere gham ki jila aur meri fikr ka khatma bana de. [Gham aur pareshani par padhe]"
"134","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bukhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se teri panah chahta hun."
